WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.356 --> 00:00:01.742
- Hey, it's your buddy Zach.

00:00:01.742 --> 00:00:03.239
Tomorrow's Thanksgiving, I'm in New York,

00:00:03.239 --> 00:00:05.172
and I'm going to see if
a stranger will invite me

00:00:05.172 --> 00:00:06.287
to their Thanksgiving dinner.

00:00:06.287 --> 00:00:07.120
Let's go.

00:00:07.120 --> 00:00:08.719
What are your plans for Thanksgiving?

00:00:08.719 --> 00:00:10.902
- We're actually going to
my sister's in Westport.

00:00:10.902 --> 00:00:12.248
- Spending it with my
family, watch football.

00:00:12.248 --> 00:00:14.581
- Do you think I could come?

00:00:16.277 --> 00:00:18.227
Would you let me come to dinner?

00:00:18.227 --> 00:00:19.412
- For sure.

00:00:19.412 --> 00:00:20.492
- Really?
- For sure.

00:00:20.492 --> 00:00:24.287
- Yeah, I mean, I guess you could come.

00:00:24.287 --> 00:00:25.215
- We won't mind.

00:00:25.215 --> 00:00:26.214
- Yeah, you're in, man!

00:00:26.214 --> 00:00:27.899
- So this is real, you're
willing to let me come over?

00:00:27.899 --> 00:00:28.851
- Yeah, sure!

00:00:28.851 --> 00:00:31.021
- Okay, do you want to hold this?

00:00:31.021 --> 00:00:32.413
- I have a pen somewhere, sorry.

00:00:32.413 --> 00:00:34.352
- So give me your address or number,

00:00:34.352 --> 00:00:35.676
however best to reach you.

00:00:35.676 --> 00:00:36.682
- Okay, here's my number.

00:00:36.682 --> 00:00:37.634
- Great!

00:00:37.634 --> 00:00:38.467
- Yeah.

00:00:40.049 --> 00:00:42.005
- So we'll meet you at the
Westport train station.

00:00:42.005 --> 00:00:43.530
- Sounds like you're trying to ditch me.

00:00:43.530 --> 00:00:44.466
- No!

00:00:44.466 --> 00:00:45.725
- Alright, so I'm going
to call your number

00:00:45.725 --> 00:00:46.558
just to make sure.

00:00:46.558 --> 00:00:47.676
Is that a three oh?

00:00:47.676 --> 00:00:49.342
- Yeah, is that you?

00:00:49.342 --> 00:00:50.175
- That's me!

00:00:50.175 --> 00:00:51.008
- Son of a gun!

00:00:51.008 --> 00:00:52.448
- Do you want me to bring anything?

00:00:52.448 --> 00:00:54.660
- No, bring yourself!

00:00:54.660 --> 00:00:55.937
- Just yourself.

00:00:55.937 --> 00:00:56.770
- No food?

00:00:56.770 --> 00:00:57.966
- We'll have food for you.

00:00:57.966 --> 00:00:58.878
- Great.

00:00:58.878 --> 00:01:00.365
This is going great.

00:01:00.365 --> 00:01:01.916
This is better than I
ever could have expected.

00:01:01.916 --> 00:01:03.795
So far everyone has said yes,

00:01:03.795 --> 00:01:05.190
I can come to their Thanksgiving dinner,

00:01:05.190 --> 00:01:07.847
which is awesome but
also a little surprising.

00:01:07.847 --> 00:01:09.840
We think the microphone might
have something to do with it,

00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:12.166
so I'm going to ditch this,
and then just go ask people.

00:01:12.166 --> 00:01:13.878
So let's see what happens.

00:01:13.878 --> 00:01:15.221
Excuse me, I have a quick question.

00:01:15.221 --> 00:01:16.054
Do you have one second?

00:01:16.054 --> 00:01:17.526
I don't have Thanksgiving plans,

00:01:17.526 --> 00:01:20.330
would you let someone like me come?

00:01:20.330 --> 00:01:21.740
- No, I'm so sorry.

00:01:21.740 --> 00:01:22.646
- I'm flying home tomorrow.

00:01:22.646 --> 00:01:24.396
- I'm from Las Vegas.

00:01:25.510 --> 00:01:26.402
- We're not hosting so
it's not our choice.

00:01:26.402 --> 00:01:28.613
- Would they be weirded out if I came?

00:01:28.613 --> 00:01:29.966
- I think so.

00:01:29.966 --> 00:01:30.799
- Yeah.

00:01:30.799 --> 00:01:34.000
Of course, I'm sorry to bother you.

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:35.199
Excuse me, I have a question.

00:01:35.199 --> 00:01:39.366
Would you be okay with me
joining your Thanksgiving dinner?

00:01:40.232 --> 00:01:41.065
- Yeah?

00:01:41.065 --> 00:01:41.898
- Sure!

00:01:41.898 --> 00:01:43.832
- I'm actually filming
a video for BuzzFeed,

00:01:43.832 --> 00:01:46.241
and I'm wondering, would
you mind coming to talk

00:01:46.241 --> 00:01:47.153
to me about it real quick?

00:01:47.153 --> 00:01:47.986
- Sure!

00:01:47.986 --> 00:01:48.948
I want everyone to feel like they've got

00:01:48.948 --> 00:01:50.475
a place to stay for Thanksgiving,

00:01:50.475 --> 00:01:51.816
and have a sense of family,

00:01:51.816 --> 00:01:54.138
even if they don't have family nearby.

00:01:54.138 --> 00:01:55.618
- I feel all warm and fuzzy inside.

00:01:55.618 --> 00:01:57.011
This is great, you guys are great people.

00:01:57.011 --> 00:01:57.876
- Thanks.

00:01:57.876 --> 00:01:58.709
- Thank you!

00:01:58.709 --> 00:01:59.988
- Love makes the world go round.

00:01:59.988 --> 00:02:01.805
- Happy Thanksgiving!

00:02:01.805 --> 00:02:02.956
- Please.

00:02:02.956 --> 00:02:05.351
- Okay, we have to do this together.

00:02:05.351 --> 00:02:06.184
- Okay, ready?

00:02:06.184 --> 00:02:07.017
You lead.

00:02:07.017 --> 00:02:11.184
♫ Thanksgiving is tomorrow

00:02:11.184 --> 00:02:15.351
